WEBVTT

03:54.902 --> 03:56.613
At last.

04:07.165 --> 04:10.793
Snoke trained you well.

04:11.461 --> 04:13.087
I killed Snoke.

04:13.254 --> 04:14.797
I'll kill you.

04:15.173 --> 04:17.050
My boy.

04:18.009 --> 04:20.720
I made Snoke.

04:23.222 --> 04:25.642
I have been every voice...

04:25.808 --> 04:27.393
you have ever heard...

04:27.560 --> 04:29.812
<i>inside your head.</i>

04:45.328 --> 04:48.373
The First Order was just the beginning.

04:49.082 --> 04:53.378
I will give you so much more.

04:53.544 --> 04:55.046
You'll die first.

04:55.213 --> 04:57.757
I have died before.

04:59.300 --> 05:02.470
The dark side of the Force
is a pathway...

05:02.637 --> 05:06.641
to many abilities some consider to be...

05:08.393 --> 05:10.228
unnatural.

05:19.070 --> 05:21.823
What could you give me?

05:22.949 --> 05:24.492
Everything.

05:27.453 --> 05:30.331
A new Empire.

05:53.020 --> 05:57.608
<i>The might of the Final Order
will soon be ready.</i>

05:59.068 --> 06:03.114
<i>It will be yours
if you do as I ask.</i>

06:04.240 --> 06:06.492
Kill the girl!

06:06.993 --> 06:08.786
End the Jedi...

06:08.953 --> 06:13.166
and become what
your grandfather Vader could not.

06:17.003 --> 06:20.089
You will rule all the galaxy...

06:20.256 --> 06:22.925
as the new emperor.

06:23.718 --> 06:25.553
But beware...

06:26.596 --> 06:28.639
she is not who you think she is.

06:32.143 --> 06:33.895
Who is she?

06:58.085 --> 06:59.128
Are you ever gonna go?

07:02.673 --> 07:04.713
- He can't beat us every time.
- Apparently he does.

07:04.801 --> 07:05.801
How does he do it?

07:05.885 --> 07:07.565
This guy right here?
It's 'cause he cheats.

07:08.221 --> 07:09.782
- I'm kidding!
- Come on. Take your turn.

07:09.806 --> 07:11.408
- You're 250 years old.
- You're taking forever. That's cheating.

07:11.432 --> 07:14.312
- Of course you're better than us.
- That's why we think you're cheating.

07:16.437 --> 07:18.231
- Don't worry!
- We're not gonna turn it off.

07:19.690 --> 07:21.275
- He's cheating.
- Definitely.

07:22.735 --> 07:24.654
Klaud, I hope you fixed that surge.

07:32.370 --> 07:33.579
T-minus five.

07:33.746 --> 07:34.747
Artoo..

07:47.385 --> 07:50.012
Boolio, good to see you.
You got something for us?

07:50.179 --> 07:52.890
From a new ally!
A spy in the First Order!

07:53.975 --> 07:55.893
A spy? Who?

07:56.060 --> 07:57.270
I don't know!

07:57.436 --> 08:00.398
Transfer the message!
Get it to Leia, hurry!

08:02.275 --> 08:03.943
This could be big, Artoo.

08:14.829 --> 08:16.205
<i>Locked on target.</i>

08:16.664 --> 08:18.165
Finn, we're about to be cooked!

08:18.332 --> 08:19.625
We're almost there!

08:21.127 --> 08:22.461
Poe, we got it.

08:22.628 --> 08:23.796
How do we thank you?

08:23.963 --> 08:25.673
Win the war!

08:32.889 --> 08:34.515
Sorry, I'm sorry!
I know!

08:43.065 --> 08:46.110
Finn, you're supposed
to be getting rid of those things!

08:50.114 --> 08:51.532
- I got one!
- How many are left?

08:51.699 --> 08:52.783
Too many.

08:53.826 --> 08:54.869
What?

08:58.789 --> 09:01.626
Good thinking, Chewie.
Finn, we can boulder these TIEs!

09:01.792 --> 09:03.252
I was just thinking that.

09:17.266 --> 09:18.601
<i>Get us back to base!</i>

09:19.602 --> 09:21.202
How thick do you think that ice wall is?

09:32.281 --> 09:33.281
- Poe!
- I know, I know!

09:37.286 --> 09:38.537
What are you doing?

09:38.704 --> 09:39.705
Lightspeed skipping.

09:40.623 --> 09:41.999
How do you know how to do that?

09:48.255 --> 09:50.007
Yeah, well, Rey's not here, is she?

09:57.014 --> 09:58.641
Last jump, maybe forever.

09:59.392 --> 10:00.601
Hold on!

10:14.448 --> 10:15.908
Be with me.

10:19.161 --> 10:20.621
Be with me.

10:23.040 --> 10:24.500
Be with me.

10:26.794 --> 10:28.295
They're not with me.

10:34.301 --> 10:35.720
Rey.

10:36.303 --> 10:37.388
Be patient.

10:37.555 --> 10:39.390
I'm starting to think
it isn't possible...

10:39.557 --> 10:41.517
to hear voices of the Jedi
who came before.

10:42.018 --> 10:43.394
Nothing's impossible.

10:43.936 --> 10:45.312
Nothing's impossible.

10:45.479 --> 10:47.023
I'm gonna run the training course.

12:23.494 --> 12:24.912
<i>No!</i>

12:25.079 --> 12:26.122
Join me.

12:26.288 --> 12:27.748
<i>Join me.</i>

12:27.915 --> 12:29.375
<i>Ben, no!</i>

12:29.542 --> 12:30.543
<i>You killed him!</i>

12:30.709 --> 12:31.919
Ben!

12:45.182 --> 12:46.684
BB-8, I'm so sorry.

12:50.396 --> 12:52.106
I didn't finish the training course.

12:52.648 --> 12:54.024
Got distracted.

12:59.113 --> 13:01.282
I'm just not feeling myself.

13:01.866 --> 13:03.284
I know it looks...

13:04.118 --> 13:05.619
It looks like I'm making excuses.

13:06.328 --> 13:09.081
Don't tell me what things look like.
Tell me what they are.

13:11.333 --> 13:13.794
I think I'm just tired.
That's all.

13:15.421 --> 13:16.547
General...

13:16.714 --> 13:18.799
the <i>Falcon</i> still hasn't arrived.

13:18.966 --> 13:20.551
Commander's asking for guidance.

13:24.680 --> 13:26.473
I will earn your brother's saber...

13:27.016 --> 13:28.225
one day.

13:31.353 --> 13:33.480
No, you can't do it for me.

13:33.647 --> 13:35.858
Never underestimate a droid.

13:38.152 --> 13:39.862
Yes, Master.

13:48.787 --> 13:49.788
Rey!

13:50.497 --> 13:51.790
<i>Falcon's</i> back!

13:53.959 --> 13:55.211
Come on, get over here!

13:55.377 --> 13:56.712
I need a fire crew here!

13:56.879 --> 13:58.964
And another one in the back!
Go, go!

13:59.131 --> 14:00.507
Coming!

14:01.008 --> 14:02.009
It's on fire!

14:02.885 --> 14:04.845
Whole thing's on fire.
All of it.

14:05.012 --> 14:06.096
- It's on fire.
- Hey.

14:06.263 --> 14:07.556
- Hey!
- There's a spy?

14:07.723 --> 14:09.403
Really could have
used your help out there.

14:09.558 --> 14:10.559
How'd it go?

14:10.726 --> 14:12.353
Really bad, actually.
Really bad.

14:12.519 --> 14:14.279
- Han's ship...
- What'd you do to the droid?

14:14.521 --> 14:15.641
What'd you do to the <i>Falcon?</i>

14:15.773 --> 14:17.417
The <i>Falcon's</i> in a lot better shape
than he is.

14:17.441 --> 14:19.818
- BB-8's not on fire.
- What's left of him isn't on fire.

14:19.902 --> 14:21.588
- Tell me what happened.
- You tell me first.

14:21.612 --> 14:22.797
- You know what you are?
- What?

14:22.821 --> 14:24.281
You're difficult. Really difficult.

14:24.365 --> 14:25.926
- You're a difficult man.
- You, you are...

14:25.950 --> 14:27.034
- Rey.
- Finn.

14:28.118 --> 14:29.118
You made it back.

14:29.161 --> 14:30.204
Yeah. Barely.

14:30.621 --> 14:32.414
- So, bad mood?
- Me?

14:32.581 --> 14:34.041
- Him.
- Always.

14:34.833 --> 14:35.918
Do we have a spy?

14:36.001 --> 14:37.001
Well...

14:38.003 --> 14:39.046
You lightspeed skipped?

14:39.129 --> 14:40.482
Yeah, well,
it got us back here, didn't it?

14:40.506 --> 14:41.674
Poe, the compressor's down.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.634
- I know, I was there.
- Every time.

14:43.717 --> 14:45.153
You can't lightspeed skip the <i>Falcon!</i>

14:45.177 --> 14:47.906
- Actually, it turns out you can.
- All right, guys, we just landed, okay?

14:47.930 --> 14:48.930
What happened?

14:48.973 --> 14:50.033
Bad news, that's what happened.

14:50.057 --> 14:51.057
No spy?

14:51.100 --> 14:52.142
No.
Spy.

14:52.309 --> 14:53.828
Did we make contact with a spy or not?

14:53.852 --> 14:56.122
There's a mole in the First Order,
and they sent us a message.

14:56.146 --> 14:57.564
You dropped a tree on him?

14:57.731 --> 14:59.459
- You blew both sub-alternators?
- Well, you know what...

14:59.483 --> 15:00.794
maybe you should've been out there
with us!

15:00.818 --> 15:02.379
- You know I wanna be out there with you.
- Yeah, but you're not.

15:02.403 --> 15:04.154
You're here training.
For what?

15:04.947 --> 15:06.448
You're the best fighter we have.

15:07.157 --> 15:08.325
We need you.

15:08.492 --> 15:09.827
Out there, not here.

15:10.202 --> 15:11.245
Junior...

15:11.829 --> 15:12.787
get Artoo into reconditioning.

15:12.788 --> 15:13.831
It's true.

15:16.083 --> 15:17.376
What's the message?

15:18.585 --> 15:21.088
We've decoded the Intel
from the First Order spy...

15:21.255 --> 15:22.923
and it confirms the worst.

15:25.426 --> 15:27.011
Somehow, Palpatine returned.

15:31.890 --> 15:33.600
Wait. Do we believe this?

15:33.767 --> 15:35.144
It cannot be.

15:35.311 --> 15:36.395
The Emperor is dead.

15:36.478 --> 15:38.814
Dark science.
Cloning.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.520
Secrets only the Sith knew.

15:40.941 --> 15:42.401
He's been planning his revenge.

15:42.985 --> 15:45.738
His followers have been building
something for years.

15:46.655 --> 15:49.033
The largest fleet
the galaxy has ever known.

15:50.492 --> 15:52.578
He calls it the Final Order.

15:52.995 --> 15:56.165
In 16 hours,
attacks on all free worlds begin.

15:57.833 --> 16:00.433
The Emperor and his fleet
have been hiding in the Unknown Regions.

16:01.420 --> 16:02.671
On a world called Exegol.

16:06.008 --> 16:08.677
Exegol does not appear
on any star chart.

16:09.636 --> 16:13.182
But legend describes it
as the hidden world of the Sith.

16:14.141 --> 16:17.227
There were always whispers
of his hunger to cheat death.

16:18.354 --> 16:20.439
So, Palpatine's been
out there all this time.

16:20.606 --> 16:22.107
Pulling the strings.

16:22.274 --> 16:24.693
Always. In the shadows.
From the very beginning.

16:25.110 --> 16:28.280
If we want to stop him,
we must find him.

16:29.656 --> 16:30.949
Must find Exegol.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.451
General?

16:34.453 --> 16:35.871
Can I speak with you?

16:36.038 --> 16:37.623
I know how to get to Exegol.

16:37.790 --> 16:39.917
- Tell me.
- Luke searched for it.

16:40.000 --> 16:42.294
For a long time.
He nearly found it.

16:42.461 --> 16:44.380
There are ciphers here
I can't read.

16:44.880 --> 16:47.383
But he said to get there,
you need one of these.

16:47.549 --> 16:48.842
A Sith wayfinder.

16:49.510 --> 16:51.970
They're compasses
that lead the way to Exegol.

16:52.513 --> 16:54.515
To stop
what we both know is coming...

16:55.182 --> 16:57.059
I need to finish what Luke started.

16:58.268 --> 16:59.269
Find Exegol.

16:59.603 --> 17:00.729
Find the Emperor.

17:00.896 --> 17:02.022
No.

17:03.524 --> 17:05.692
I don't want to go
without your blessing, but I will.

17:08.362 --> 17:09.446
I will.

17:10.823 --> 17:12.408
It's what you would do.

17:14.201 --> 17:15.387
So, you got her up and running?

17:15.411 --> 17:16.453
You were right before.

17:17.121 --> 17:19.081
I'm gonna pick up
Luke's search for Exegol.

17:19.248 --> 17:21.333
I'm gonna start
where his trail went cold.

17:21.500 --> 17:23.043
The Forbidden Desert of Pasaana.

17:23.419 --> 17:25.045
Yeah, I know. We're going with you.

17:25.838 --> 17:27.714
Chewie, you get that compressor fixed?

17:28.507 --> 17:29.675
I need to go alone.

17:29.842 --> 17:30.843
Yeah. Alone with friends.

17:30.926 --> 17:32.052
It's too dangerous, Finn.

17:32.928 --> 17:34.012
We go together.

17:38.517 --> 17:39.893
I wholeheartedly agree.

17:45.774 --> 17:46.774
Rose, last chance.

17:46.900 --> 17:49.181
The General asked me to study the specs
of old Destroyers.

17:49.319 --> 17:50.879
So we can stop the fleet
if you find it.

17:50.904 --> 17:51.947
"If"?

17:52.406 --> 17:53.490
When.

17:54.658 --> 17:55.658
When.

18:04.751 --> 18:05.961
Hey, we should get going.

18:08.422 --> 18:09.423
What is it?

18:10.215 --> 18:11.258
Nothing.

18:12.217 --> 18:14.303
In the event that I do not return...

18:15.053 --> 18:18.599
I want you to know
that you have been a real friend, Artoo.

18:19.683 --> 18:21.185
My best one, in fact.

18:26.190 --> 18:28.984
There's so much I want to tell you.

18:30.694 --> 18:32.654
Tell me when you get back.

18:54.718 --> 18:55.761
Rey...

18:55.928 --> 18:58.764
never be afraid of who you are.

19:20.410 --> 19:21.411
It is.

20:10.085 --> 20:12.212
<i>- Knights of Ren.
- Ghouls.</i>

20:16.341 --> 20:18.218
<i>We have a spy in our ranks...</i>

20:18.719 --> 20:21.013
<i>who just sent a message
to the Resistance.</i>

20:21.847 --> 20:24.808
<i>Whoever this traitor is won't stop us.</i>

20:26.393 --> 20:28.270
<i>With what I've seen on Exegol...</i>

20:28.770 --> 20:31.607
<i>the First Order is about to become
a true Empire.</i>

20:35.319 --> 20:39.364
<i>I sense unease about my appearance,
General Hux.</i>

20:42.909 --> 20:44.286
About the mask?

20:44.453 --> 20:46.663
No, sir. Well done.

20:46.830 --> 20:47.998
I like it.

20:48.165 --> 20:52.252
Forgive me, sir,
but these allies on Exegol...

20:52.419 --> 20:53.503
they sound like a cult.

20:53.670 --> 20:55.631
Conjurers and soothsayers.

20:55.714 --> 20:57.966
They've conjured
legions of Star Destroyers.

20:58.050 --> 21:01.261
The Sith fleet will increase
our resources ten-thousandfold.

21:02.095 --> 21:03.305
Such range and power

21:03.388 --> 21:05.974
will correct the error
of Starkiller Base.

21:06.141 --> 21:09.645
We'll need to increase recruitments.
Harvest more of the galaxy's young.

21:09.811 --> 21:11.938
This fleet, what is it, a gift?

21:12.105 --> 21:14.149
What is he asking for in return?

21:17.152 --> 21:20.238
<i>Prepare to crush
any worlds that defy us.</i>

21:20.697 --> 21:23.909
<i>My knights and I are going hunting
for the scavenger.</i>

21:33.710 --> 21:34.920
You sure this is it?

21:35.087 --> 21:38.090
These are the exact coordinates
that Master Luke left behind.

21:44.846 --> 21:46.139
What is this?

21:46.306 --> 21:48.892
The Acky Acky Festival of the Ancestors.

21:49.393 --> 21:52.813
This celebration occurs
only once every 42 years.

21:52.979 --> 21:53.980
Well, that's lucky.

21:54.147 --> 21:55.440
Lucky indeed.

21:55.607 --> 21:58.110
This festival is known for both
its colorful kites...

21:58.276 --> 22:00.362
and its delectable sweets.

22:21.883 --> 22:23.885
I've never seen anything like this.

22:24.094 --> 22:25.762
I've never seen so few wayfinders.

22:25.929 --> 22:27.013
There's always random

22:27.097 --> 22:29.182
First Order patrols
in crowds like these.

22:29.349 --> 22:30.809
So, keep your heads down.

22:30.976 --> 22:31.976
Chewie.

22:37.107 --> 22:39.443
Let's split up.
See what the locals know.

23:00.756 --> 23:02.632
She is saying, "Welcome."

23:11.141 --> 23:13.643
Her name is Nambi Ghima.

23:13.810 --> 23:16.146
That's an excellent name. I'm Rey.

23:18.356 --> 23:21.067
She would be honored
to know your family name, too.

23:24.154 --> 23:25.614
I don't have one.

23:25.781 --> 23:27.032
I'm just Rey.

23:46.802 --> 23:49.179
<i>Palpatine wants you dead.</i>

23:50.722 --> 23:53.099
- Serving another master?
<i>- No.</i>

23:54.100 --> 23:55.602
<i>I have other plans.</i>

23:56.478 --> 23:58.313
<i>I offered you my hand once.</i>

23:59.147 --> 24:00.774
<i>You wanted to take it.</i>

24:02.192 --> 24:03.193
<i>Why didn't you?</i>

24:04.444 --> 24:06.196
You could've killed me.

24:06.363 --> 24:07.739
Why didn't you?

24:09.282 --> 24:10.992
<i>You can't hide, Rey.</i>

24:11.159 --> 24:12.244
<i>Not from me.</i>

24:13.745 --> 24:16.373
I see through the cracks in your mask.

24:16.540 --> 24:18.041
You're haunted.

24:18.208 --> 24:21.336
You can't stop seeing
what you did to your father.

24:22.420 --> 24:25.090
<i>Do you still count the days
since your parents left?</i>

24:26.466 --> 24:29.511
<i>Such pain in you, such anger.</i>

24:30.470 --> 24:32.138
<i>I don't wanna have to kill you.</i>

24:33.390 --> 24:34.432
<i>I'm going to find you</i>

24:34.516 --> 24:36.476
<i>and I'm going to turn you
to the dark side.</i>

24:38.144 --> 24:40.188
<i>When I offer you my hand again...</i>

24:41.189 --> 24:42.190
<i>you'll take it.</i>

24:44.109 --> 24:45.110
We'll see.

24:51.324 --> 24:52.324
Has he seen him?

24:52.325 --> 24:54.828
We have to go. Back to the <i>Falcon</i>. Now.

24:54.911 --> 24:56.538
- Why?
- It's Ren.

24:58.832 --> 25:00.250
Sir, we've had this analyzed.

25:00.375 --> 25:03.378
It comes from the Middian System,
Pasaana, Forbidden Valley.

25:03.461 --> 25:04.462
<i>Prepare my ship.</i>

25:04.629 --> 25:06.590
<i>Alert the local troops.
Send a division.</i>

25:07.048 --> 25:09.259
Yes, Supreme Leader.

25:12.220 --> 25:13.220
<i>Freeze.</i>

25:13.471 --> 25:14.598
<i>Hold it right there.</i>

25:14.764 --> 25:16.391
<i>I've located the Resistance fugitives.</i>

25:16.558 --> 25:17.601
<i>All units, report...</i>

25:23.273 --> 25:24.441
<i>Follow me.</i>

25:32.741 --> 25:34.034
<i>Hurry.</i>

25:35.869 --> 25:37.579
<i>Leia sent me a transmission.</i>

25:39.456 --> 25:40.457
Okay.

25:40.999 --> 25:42.542
How'd you find us?

25:44.711 --> 25:46.379
Wookiees stand out in a crowd.

25:50.508 --> 25:52.469
It's good to see you too, old buddy.

25:52.802 --> 25:54.846
This is General Lando Calrissian.

25:54.930 --> 25:55.990
We know who he is, Threepio.

25:56.014 --> 25:57.641
It is an honor, General.

25:58.350 --> 26:00.644
General Calrissian,
we're looking for Exegol.

26:03.313 --> 26:04.773
Of course you are.

26:07.525 --> 26:08.735
Only two were made.

26:09.027 --> 26:10.028
A Sith wayfinder.

26:11.196 --> 26:12.676
Luke Skywalker came here to find one.

26:13.073 --> 26:15.158
I know. I was with him.

26:15.951 --> 26:18.161
Luke and I were tailing
an old Jedi hunter.

26:19.371 --> 26:20.747
Ochi of Bestoon.

26:21.122 --> 26:24.334
He was carrying a clue
that could lead to a wayfinder.

26:24.918 --> 26:27.504
We followed his ship
halfway across the galaxy here.

26:27.879 --> 26:30.006
When we got to his ship,
it was abandoned...

26:30.173 --> 26:32.676
No clue.
No wayfinder.

26:33.176 --> 26:34.344
Is Ochi's ship still here?

26:34.511 --> 26:36.221
It's out in the desert,
where he left it.

26:36.388 --> 26:38.682
We need to get to that ship.
Search it again.

26:47.190 --> 26:49.275
I got a bad feeling about this.

26:49.693 --> 26:52.070
Ochi's ship is out past Lurch Canyon.

26:52.237 --> 26:53.863
- Go.
- Thank you, General.

26:54.864 --> 26:56.324
You too, Chewie.

26:56.491 --> 26:58.118
Leia needs pilots, General.

26:58.284 --> 27:01.037
My flying days are long gone.

27:01.204 --> 27:02.706
But do me a favor...

27:03.915 --> 27:05.959
give Leia my love.

27:06.126 --> 27:08.378
You should give it to her yourself.

27:08.545 --> 27:09.629
Thank you.

27:17.762 --> 27:19.264
There! Those speeders.

27:29.691 --> 27:31.026
How do you know how to do that?

27:31.401 --> 27:33.028
No need to worry. I made it.

27:35.780 --> 27:36.906
We gotta go.

27:43.121 --> 27:44.372
<i>We've spotted the fugitives.</i>

28:04.893 --> 28:06.311
They fly now!

28:06.394 --> 28:07.687
They fly now?

28:08.438 --> 28:09.439
They fly now.

28:33.546 --> 28:34.756
Did we lose them?

28:34.923 --> 28:36.591
- Looks like it!
- Excellent job, sir!

28:40.053 --> 28:41.262
Terrible job, sir!

28:46.392 --> 28:47.769
Not now, BB-8.

29:00.698 --> 29:02.826
Never underestimate a droid.

29:22.846 --> 29:23.847
Poe!

29:28.768 --> 29:29.769
Yeah!

29:29.936 --> 29:31.146
Right, ho!

29:45.368 --> 29:46.411
Ochi's ship.

29:47.787 --> 29:49.330
I've seen that ship before.

29:49.497 --> 29:50.497
Rey!

29:50.582 --> 29:51.708
You get all of them?

30:14.522 --> 30:15.607
What the hell is this?

30:17.317 --> 30:19.569
Sinking fields! Try to grab something!

30:19.736 --> 30:21.988
Will this agony ever end?

30:22.530 --> 30:23.531
Come on!

30:23.698 --> 30:25.575
BB-8! No!

30:25.742 --> 30:26.742
Rey.

30:26.784 --> 30:28.036
Rey, I never told you...

30:28.203 --> 30:29.829
What? Finn!

30:42.759 --> 30:43.843
General.

30:44.010 --> 30:46.238
We're getting reports of a raid
at the Festival of Ancestors.

30:46.262 --> 30:48.973
This mission is everything.
We cannot fail.

30:49.140 --> 30:50.767
Any word from Rey?

30:50.934 --> 30:52.018
<i>Falcon's</i> not responding.

30:52.894 --> 30:54.174
Do you have to say it like that?

30:54.312 --> 30:55.312
Like what?

30:55.396 --> 30:57.732
Do me a personal favor?
Be optimistic.

30:58.107 --> 30:59.359
Yes, ma'am.

30:59.525 --> 31:01.402
This is terrific.

31:01.569 --> 31:03.547
You're not gonna believe
how well this is gonna turn out.

31:03.571 --> 31:04.781
It's gonna be great.

31:13.039 --> 31:14.624
Rey! Finn!

31:14.791 --> 31:17.043
You didn't say my name, sir,
but I'm all right.

31:23.091 --> 31:24.259
- You all right?
- Yeah.

31:24.425 --> 31:25.425
Where's Finn?

31:25.468 --> 31:26.469
Where's Chewie?

31:28.554 --> 31:29.555
I'm good.

31:29.973 --> 31:30.973
Master Finn.

31:31.057 --> 31:32.058
What is this place?

31:32.225 --> 31:33.810
This isn't the afterlife, is it?

31:33.893 --> 31:34.978
Are droids allowed here?

31:35.061 --> 31:36.062
I thought we were goners.

31:36.145 --> 31:37.355
We might still be.

31:37.438 --> 31:38.856
Which way out?

31:45.113 --> 31:46.656
We have to hurry.

31:47.156 --> 31:48.741
- So, what was it?
- What?

31:48.908 --> 31:50.868
- What you were gonna tell me?
- When?

31:50.952 --> 31:52.388
When you were sinking in the sand,
you said...

31:52.412 --> 31:53.788
"I never told you..."

31:54.956 --> 31:56.040
I'll tell you later.

31:56.124 --> 31:57.417
You mean when Poe's not here?

31:58.042 --> 31:59.168
Yeah.

31:59.335 --> 32:01.605
We're gonna die in sand burrows
and we're all keeping secrets?

32:01.629 --> 32:04.424
I'll tell you when you tell us
about all that shifty stuff you do.

32:05.550 --> 32:07.343
I do not wanna know
what made these tunnels.

32:07.510 --> 32:09.804
Judging by the circumference
of the tunnel walls...

32:09.971 --> 32:11.180
I said I do not wanna know.

32:11.472 --> 32:12.682
Not.

32:12.849 --> 32:13.849
What's that?

32:13.975 --> 32:15.143
- Is that a speeder?
- What?

32:15.310 --> 32:16.311
An old one.

32:16.477 --> 32:18.313
Perhaps we will find the driver.

32:18.938 --> 32:20.815
Yep, BB-8, I think dead, too.

32:20.982 --> 32:23.318
Oh, my. A hex charm.

32:23.484 --> 32:24.484
A what?

32:24.485 --> 32:26.821
A common emblem of Sith loyalists.

32:26.988 --> 32:27.988
Sith.

32:28.114 --> 32:29.240
This was Ochi's?

32:29.407 --> 32:31.826
Luke sensed it.
Ochi never left this place.

32:32.952 --> 32:35.233
- And he ended up down here.
- He was headed for his ship.

32:35.747 --> 32:37.266
Same thing happened to us,
happened to him.

32:37.290 --> 32:38.541
So, how did Ochi get out?

32:38.708 --> 32:39.708
He didn't.

32:44.130 --> 32:45.131
No, he didn't.

32:45.298 --> 32:46.632
Bones.

32:46.799 --> 32:48.051
I don't like bones.

32:48.343 --> 32:50.553
Bones? Never a good sign.

32:52.638 --> 32:53.890
Yeah, I see it.

33:06.527 --> 33:08.154
Horrible things...

33:08.905 --> 33:10.114
have happened with this.

33:10.281 --> 33:11.324
There's writing on it.

33:11.908 --> 33:13.826
Perhaps I can translate.

33:15.244 --> 33:19.540
The location of the wayfinder,
has been inscribed upon this dagger.

33:19.624 --> 33:22.251
It's the clue that Master Luke
was looking for.

33:22.418 --> 33:23.920
- And?
- Where's the wayfinder?

33:24.462 --> 33:26.839
I am afraid I cannot tell you.

33:27.382 --> 33:29.300
20.3 fazillion languages,
you can't read that?

33:29.467 --> 33:30.802
I have read it, sir.

33:31.010 --> 33:34.055
I know exactly where the wayfinder is.

33:34.222 --> 33:38.309
Unfortunately, it is written
in the runic language of the Sith.

33:38.476 --> 33:39.519
So what?

33:39.685 --> 33:41.854
My programming forbids me
from translating it.

33:42.021 --> 33:44.732
So, you're telling us the one time
we need you to talk, you can't?

33:44.899 --> 33:46.109
Irony, sir.

33:46.818 --> 33:50.113
I am mechanically incapable
of speaking translations from Sith.

33:50.238 --> 33:53.699
I believe the rule was passed
by the Senate of the Old Republic...

33:55.451 --> 33:58.371
Serpent! Serpent! Serpent!

34:11.926 --> 34:13.344
Rey.

34:21.602 --> 34:22.603
Finn.

34:39.454 --> 34:40.974
- I'm gonna blast it.
- Don't blast it.

35:38.971 --> 35:40.291
I just transferred a bit of life.

35:40.932 --> 35:42.725
Force energy from me to him.

35:43.893 --> 35:45.186
You would've done the same.

36:07.124 --> 36:09.418
We cannot possibly fly in
that old wreck.

36:09.585 --> 36:10.586
We gotta keep moving.

36:10.753 --> 36:12.588
Find someone
who can translate that dagger.

36:12.755 --> 36:13.839
Like a helpful droid.

36:14.006 --> 36:17.009
I suggest we return
to the <i>Millennium Falcon</i> at once.

36:17.176 --> 36:18.570
They'll be waiting for us at the <i>Falcon.</i>

36:18.594 --> 36:20.274
Yeah, they'll throw us
in the Pits of Griq.

36:20.304 --> 36:22.848
Yeah.
And use you as a target droid.

36:23.015 --> 36:25.851
You both make excellent points,
at times.

36:29.897 --> 36:30.982
What is it?

36:32.149 --> 36:33.526
I'll be right behind you.

36:34.402 --> 36:35.403
It's okay.

36:45.329 --> 36:46.622
Let's see what we got.

36:48.583 --> 36:50.501
Let's get those converters fired up.

36:57.174 --> 36:58.801
What a filthy ship!

37:00.553 --> 37:01.554
Look at that.

37:02.847 --> 37:03.848
Where is she?

37:08.853 --> 37:10.730
Finn, help me out over here.

37:10.896 --> 37:12.607
Chewie, tell Rey we gotta go.

38:01.864 --> 38:02.865
What's she doing?

38:03.366 --> 38:04.617
Where the hell's Chewie?

38:07.662 --> 38:08.663
It's Ren.

38:24.178 --> 38:25.513
<i>All right, let's go.</i>

38:26.472 --> 38:27.473
<i>Get in the transport.</i>

38:27.640 --> 38:28.724
<i>Move, animal!</i>

39:44.508 --> 39:45.509
Rey!

39:46.135 --> 39:47.178
Rey!

39:48.888 --> 39:51.432
They got Chewie!
They got him!

40:59.375 --> 41:00.417
Chewie!

41:00.501 --> 41:01.585
No!

41:07.007 --> 41:08.050
Rey!

41:10.636 --> 41:12.304
We gotta go!
They're coming!

41:13.055 --> 41:14.431
Rey, come on!

41:17.560 --> 41:18.561
Rey!

41:20.020 --> 41:22.439
- We gotta go!
- Chewie.

41:22.523 --> 41:24.358
Rey, come on!

41:45.671 --> 41:47.214
I lost control.

41:48.507 --> 41:49.758
It wasn't your fault.

41:49.925 --> 41:50.926
It was.

41:51.093 --> 41:53.262
No. It was Ren.
He made you do it.

41:53.429 --> 41:54.722
Chewie's gone.

41:55.681 --> 41:57.266
That power came from me.

41:58.350 --> 42:00.269
Finn, there are things you don't know.

42:01.520 --> 42:03.355
Then tell me.

42:10.863 --> 42:11.989
I had a vision.

42:14.783 --> 42:16.493
Of the throne of the Sith.

42:18.120 --> 42:19.496
And who was on it.

42:20.331 --> 42:21.332
Ren?

42:23.959 --> 42:25.210
And me.

42:40.267 --> 42:43.103
We recovered the scavenger's ship,
but she got away.

42:43.646 --> 42:46.357
Under command of the Knights of Ren,
we suffered losses.

42:46.523 --> 42:48.776
- A transport was destroyed.
- I've seen the report.

42:49.360 --> 42:50.486
That all?

42:51.153 --> 42:52.655
No, Allegiant General.

42:52.821 --> 42:54.461
There was another transport
in the desert.

42:56.116 --> 42:58.118
It brought back a valuable prisoner.

43:00.079 --> 43:01.372
Prisoner?

43:06.502 --> 43:09.004
The beast used to fly with Han Solo.

43:11.298 --> 43:13.217
Take it to Interrogation Six.

43:13.384 --> 43:14.802
<i>Move it.</i>

43:15.636 --> 43:18.305
We've only got eight hours left.
So, what are we gonna do?

43:18.472 --> 43:20.072
What can we do?
We gotta go back to base.

43:20.099 --> 43:22.118
We don't have time to go back.
We are not giving up.

43:22.142 --> 43:23.727
If we do that,
Chewie died for nothing.

43:23.811 --> 43:25.479
Poe, Chewie had the dagger!

43:25.646 --> 43:26.957
- Well, then we gotta find another way.
- Well, there isn't.

43:26.981 --> 43:29.334
That was the only clue
to the wayfinder thing, and it's gone.

43:29.358 --> 43:32.820
So true. The inscription lives
only in my memory now.

43:34.905 --> 43:35.906
Hold on.

43:36.907 --> 43:39.284
The inscription that was on the dagger
is in your memory?

43:39.702 --> 43:41.036
Yes, Master Poe.

43:41.203 --> 43:43.288
But the translation
from a forbidden language

43:43.372 --> 43:44.540
cannot be retrieved.

43:44.707 --> 43:47.501
That is short
of a complete redacted memory bypass.

43:47.668 --> 43:48.668
A complete what?

43:48.794 --> 43:50.546
It's a terribly dangerous
and sinful act...

43:50.629 --> 43:53.215
performed on unwitting droids
by dregs and criminals.

43:53.382 --> 43:54.466
Let's do that.

43:54.758 --> 43:56.385
I know a black market droidsmith.

43:56.468 --> 43:58.387
- Black market droidsmith?
- But he's on Kijimi.

43:58.470 --> 43:59.470
What's wrong with Kijimi?

43:59.805 --> 44:01.306
I had a little bad luck on Kijimi.

44:03.100 --> 44:06.020
But if this mission fails,
it's all been for nothing.

44:06.186 --> 44:08.689
All we've done, all this time.

44:10.941 --> 44:12.609
We're all in this.

44:13.944 --> 44:15.320
Until the end.

44:19.742 --> 44:20.743
For Chewie.

44:22.745 --> 44:24.163
- Hands?
- Hands.

44:25.622 --> 44:26.623
For Chewie.

44:31.628 --> 44:32.629
Kijimi.

45:06.580 --> 45:08.248
Battery charged.

45:09.583 --> 45:10.584
Hello.

45:15.714 --> 45:16.715
Hello.

45:17.299 --> 45:18.884
- Hello.
- No, thank you.

45:21.720 --> 45:23.597
Looks like someone treated him badly.

45:24.306 --> 45:26.683
It's all right.
You're with us now.

45:35.150 --> 45:38.570
<i>U-A-T-T walker patrol,
head down thoroughfare 60.</i>

45:54.044 --> 45:56.088
<i>Open up. You're wanted for questioning.</i>

46:00.801 --> 46:02.219
<i>Check this side of the street.</i>

46:06.765 --> 46:08.642
<i>Door is locked.
Move on to the next one.</i>

46:09.101 --> 46:11.270
<i>Give me regular reports, please.</i>

46:11.436 --> 46:13.605
<i>You, up against the wall.</i>

46:13.772 --> 46:15.357
<i>Show me your identification.</i>

46:16.108 --> 46:17.359
<i>Where is your identification?</i>

46:18.819 --> 46:20.028
They're everywhere.

46:20.529 --> 46:22.298
Please, leave her alone.
She didn't do anything.

46:22.322 --> 46:23.762
All right, I know what we should do.

46:23.824 --> 46:25.242
So do I. We should leave.

46:25.325 --> 46:26.743
Clam it, Threepio.

46:27.202 --> 46:28.202
Follow me.

46:35.711 --> 46:37.796
All right.
Let's head down this way.

46:39.840 --> 46:41.592
<i>Heard you were spotted at Monk's Gate.</i>

46:41.758 --> 46:44.428
<i>Thought, "He's not stupid enough
to come back here."</i>

46:44.595 --> 46:46.054
You'd be surprised.

46:46.221 --> 46:47.681
- Who's this?
- What's going on?

46:47.848 --> 46:49.933
Guys, this is Zorii.
Zorii, this is Rey and Finn.

46:50.017 --> 46:51.602
<i>I could pull this trigger right now.</i>

46:51.768 --> 46:53.288
- I've seen you do worse.
<i>- For a lot less.</i>

46:53.312 --> 46:55.898
Can we just... talk about this?

46:56.398 --> 46:57.900
<i>I wanna see your brains in the snow.</i>

46:58.567 --> 46:59.776
So, you're still mad?

46:59.943 --> 47:01.278
Zorii, we could use your help.

47:01.445 --> 47:03.214
We gotta crack this droid's head open
and fast.

47:03.238 --> 47:05.240
- Pardon me!
- We're trying to find Babu Frik.

47:05.407 --> 47:06.801
<i>Babu? Babu only works with the crew.</i>

47:06.825 --> 47:08.118
<i>That's not you anymore.</i>

47:08.285 --> 47:09.285
What crew?

47:09.411 --> 47:10.787
<i>Funny he never mentioned it.</i>

47:10.871 --> 47:13.415
<i>Your friend's old job was running spice.</i>

47:13.582 --> 47:14.625
You were a spice runner?

47:15.083 --> 47:16.936
- You were a stormtrooper?
- Were you a spice runner?

47:16.960 --> 47:18.438
Were you a scavenger?
We could do this all night.

47:18.462 --> 47:19.671
<i>You don't have all night.</i>

47:19.838 --> 47:22.257
<i>You know, I'm still
digging out of the hole you put me in...</i>

47:22.341 --> 47:24.051
<i>when you left to join the Resistance.</i>

47:25.052 --> 47:26.052
<i>You.</i>

47:26.386 --> 47:27.786
<i>You're the one they're looking for.</i>

47:28.055 --> 47:30.182
<i>Bounty for her just might cover us.</i>

47:30.349 --> 47:31.808
<i>- Djak'kankah!</i>
- Don't <i>djak'kankah.</i>

47:39.316 --> 47:41.068
We could really use your help.

47:41.235 --> 47:42.486
Please.

47:44.029 --> 47:45.489
<i>Not that you care...</i>

47:47.282 --> 47:48.742
<i>but I think you're okay.</i>

47:49.409 --> 47:50.661
I care.

47:54.915 --> 47:56.667
<i>- T-18's online yet?
- Yes, sir.</i>

47:56.833 --> 47:57.876
<i>Scouting the perimeter.</i>

47:59.544 --> 48:01.546
<i>Walkers. Stay close by.</i>

48:03.924 --> 48:06.802
Poe Dameron, spice runner.
Runner of spice.

48:06.969 --> 48:08.512
- All right.
- Get your spice!

48:08.679 --> 48:10.222
Come on, Threepio.

48:25.279 --> 48:26.697
<i>Babu's in the back.</i>

48:36.832 --> 48:38.292
Don't mind us.

48:42.838 --> 48:45.966
I haven't the faintest idea
why I agreed to this.

48:46.133 --> 48:47.759
I must be malfunctioning.

48:47.926 --> 48:49.511
I must be malfunctioning.

48:50.595 --> 48:51.847
Babu Frik?

48:52.014 --> 48:53.432
Can you help us with this?

48:59.104 --> 49:01.064
Zorii?
Is this gonna work?

49:07.696 --> 49:10.133
<i>He says he's found something
in your droid's forbidden memory bank.</i>

49:10.157 --> 49:12.034
<i>Words, translated from Sith.</i>

49:12.200 --> 49:14.036
- That's it.
- Yeah, that's what we need.

49:14.202 --> 49:16.496
<i>Who are you hanging out with
that speaks Sith?</i>

49:16.997 --> 49:18.206
Can you make him...

49:18.707 --> 49:20.876
Babu, can you make him translate it?

49:24.421 --> 49:26.006
<i>Yes. But it will cause a complete...</i>

49:26.089 --> 49:27.758
A complete memory wipe.

49:27.841 --> 49:29.601
Wait, wait, wait.
We make him translate it...

49:29.676 --> 49:31.928
he won't remember... anything?

49:32.095 --> 49:34.056
Droid, memory go blank.

49:34.222 --> 49:35.223
Blank, blank.

49:35.307 --> 49:36.467
There must be some other way.

49:36.600 --> 49:37.976
Doesn't Artoo back up your memory?

49:38.060 --> 49:41.980
Oh, please. Artoo's storage units
are famously unreliable.

49:42.481 --> 49:44.399
You know the odds better than any of us.

49:46.401 --> 49:47.819
Do we have a choice?

49:53.992 --> 49:56.078
If this mission fails...

49:56.870 --> 49:58.538
it was all for nothing.

49:59.831 --> 50:01.416
All we've done...

50:02.292 --> 50:03.877
all this time.

50:08.840 --> 50:10.240
What are you doing there, Threepio?

50:11.301 --> 50:13.887
Taking one last look, sir...

50:14.679 --> 50:16.515
at my friends.

50:19.559 --> 50:20.560
Sad.

50:25.107 --> 50:27.484
<i>Night raids are gonna start soon.
I'll keep lookout.</i>

50:27.651 --> 50:28.860
I'm coming with you.

50:29.361 --> 50:30.862
<i>You still don't trust me?</i>

50:31.071 --> 50:32.197
Did you ever trust me?

50:32.364 --> 50:33.365
<i>Nope.</i>

50:38.912 --> 50:40.247
<i>Report, General Pryde.</i>

50:40.414 --> 50:41.694
There's been a development, sir.

50:41.748 --> 50:43.750
The Knights of Ren
have tracked the scavenger.

50:43.917 --> 50:45.544
To a settlement called Kijimi.

50:45.710 --> 50:47.838
Shall we destroy the city, Supreme...?

50:55.262 --> 50:57.806
I just had an idea.
There's something else we could try.

51:12.612 --> 51:14.489
How long's it been like this?

51:14.656 --> 51:17.701
<i>First Order took most of the kids
a long time ago.</i>

51:17.868 --> 51:19.953
<i>Can't stand the cries anymore.</i>

51:20.120 --> 51:22.038
<i>I've saved up enough to get out.</i>

51:22.205 --> 51:23.331
<i>I'm going to the Colonies.</i>

51:23.498 --> 51:25.375
How?
All those hyperlanes are blocked.

51:29.546 --> 51:32.382
That's a First Order
Captain's medallion.

51:33.091 --> 51:34.676
I've never seen a real one.

51:34.843 --> 51:36.636
<i>Free passage through any blockade.</i>

51:36.720 --> 51:38.513
<i>Landing privileges, any vessel.</i>

51:47.022 --> 51:48.690
<i>Wanna come with me?</i>

51:55.363 --> 51:57.449
I can't walk out on this war.

51:59.367 --> 52:00.994
Not till it's over.

52:01.453 --> 52:02.746
Maybe it is.

52:04.915 --> 52:07.709
We sent out a call for help
at the Battle of Crait.

52:09.461 --> 52:10.962
Nobody came.

52:11.588 --> 52:13.131
Everyone's so afraid.

52:15.842 --> 52:17.177
They've given up.

52:18.720 --> 52:21.139
<i>No, I don't believe you believe that.</i>

52:24.100 --> 52:25.352
<i>Hey.</i>

52:26.186 --> 52:29.189
<i>They win by making you think
you're alone.</i>

52:30.482 --> 52:32.150
<i>Remember?</i>

52:35.028 --> 52:36.863
<i>There's more of us.</i>

52:40.784 --> 52:42.160
Squeaky wheel.

52:42.953 --> 52:44.579
I have a squeaky wheel.

52:49.251 --> 52:51.336
Squeak eliminated.

52:51.753 --> 52:53.338
Thank you.

52:53.505 --> 52:54.798
Very kind.

53:01.888 --> 53:03.723
Something's not right about all of this.

53:05.433 --> 53:06.726
I know where I've seen it.

53:06.893 --> 53:08.812
The ship he was on.
Ochi's ship.

53:09.187 --> 53:10.188
What?

53:10.730 --> 53:12.274
The day my parents left.

53:13.316 --> 53:14.776
They were on that ship.

53:16.069 --> 53:17.279
Are you sure?

53:18.280 --> 53:19.656
<i>There's an incoming Destroyer.</i>

53:19.739 --> 53:21.950
We gotta go now. Did we get it?
Babu?

53:22.117 --> 53:25.036
Yep. Droid is ready!

53:29.457 --> 53:32.544
The Emperor's wayfinder
is in the Imperial vault.

53:32.711 --> 53:36.840
At delta 3-6, transient 9-3-6,
bearing 3-2...

53:37.007 --> 53:38.508
on a moon in the Endor system.

53:39.301 --> 53:40.468
From the southern shore.

53:40.844 --> 53:42.429
Only this blade tells.

53:43.471 --> 53:45.056
Only this blade tells.

53:49.519 --> 53:50.562
The Endor system.

53:51.104 --> 53:52.272
Where the last war ended?

53:59.571 --> 54:00.655
Rey!

54:04.242 --> 54:05.410
Ren's Destroyer.

54:05.577 --> 54:06.578
He's here?

54:10.957 --> 54:12.125
Chewie?

54:13.668 --> 54:15.003
What about him?

54:15.170 --> 54:16.921
He's on Ren's ship.

54:17.088 --> 54:18.256
He's alive.

54:18.757 --> 54:20.216
What? How?

54:20.383 --> 54:22.463
He's alive! He must've been
on a different transport.

54:22.552 --> 54:23.553
We gotta go get him.

54:23.720 --> 54:25.000
<i>Your friend's on that sky trash?</i>

54:25.096 --> 54:26.222
I guess he is.

54:26.389 --> 54:27.724
Might I introduce myself.

54:27.891 --> 54:32.270
I am C-3PO, human-cyborg relations.
And you are?

54:32.437 --> 54:33.623
Okay, that's gonna be a problem.

54:33.647 --> 54:35.982
Hello. I Babu Frik.

54:36.149 --> 54:37.525
Why, hello!

54:45.408 --> 54:47.827
Threepio, move your metal ass.
We're almost there.

54:47.911 --> 54:49.788
How dare you!
We've only just met.

54:49.954 --> 54:51.122
<i>Poe.</i>

54:51.289 --> 54:52.957
<i>Might get you on a capital ship.</i>

54:53.667 --> 54:54.709
<i>Go help your friend.</i>

54:56.336 --> 54:57.813
Zorii, I don't think I can take this.

54:57.837 --> 54:59.381
<i>I don't care what you think.</i>

55:02.342 --> 55:04.302
We have to go. Now.

55:04.469 --> 55:06.513
- Come with us.
<i>- Poe.</i>

55:06.680 --> 55:07.764
Can I kiss you?

55:07.931 --> 55:08.931
<i>Go.</i>

55:14.604 --> 55:15.897
We've done nothing wrong!

55:16.064 --> 55:17.107
<i>No sudden moves.</i>

55:17.273 --> 55:18.942
<i>What is that? Stop moving.</i>

55:33.665 --> 55:34.791
Medallion's good.

55:35.375 --> 55:37.168
Clear for entrance into hangar 12.

55:37.335 --> 55:38.336
Hang on, Chewie.

55:38.503 --> 55:39.504
We're coming.

55:39.671 --> 55:42.340
Whoever this Chewie person is,
this is madness!

55:52.767 --> 55:53.893
<i>Credentials and manifest.</i>

55:55.145 --> 55:56.771
<i>Close the blast doors.</i>

56:00.108 --> 56:01.818
- You three, stay there.
- Happily.

56:01.985 --> 56:02.985
Which way?

56:03.069 --> 56:04.404
No idea. Follow me.

56:26.384 --> 56:27.594
<i>Drop your weapons.</i>

56:27.761 --> 56:29.471
It's okay that we're here.

56:30.764 --> 56:33.183
<i>- It's okay that you're here.
- It's good.</i>

56:33.266 --> 56:34.410
You're relieved that we're here.

56:34.434 --> 56:36.519
<i>- Thank goodness you're here.
- Welcome, guys.</i>

56:36.686 --> 56:38.021
Does she do that to us?

56:38.188 --> 56:40.440
We're looking for a prisoner
and his belongings.

56:42.400 --> 56:43.401
The cameras.

56:47.947 --> 56:49.365
They said Chewie's this way.

56:59.876 --> 57:00.877
Rey, come on.

57:00.960 --> 57:03.129
The dagger is on this ship.
We need it.

57:04.088 --> 57:05.089
Why?

57:06.883 --> 57:08.843
A feeling.
I'll meet you back at the hangar.

57:08.927 --> 57:09.969
Rey, you can't just...

57:11.221 --> 57:12.222
Chewie.

57:18.269 --> 57:19.854
<i>Search the city again.</i>

57:22.106 --> 57:23.608
<i>She's close.</i>

57:27.612 --> 57:29.239
Of course we came for you, Chewie.

57:29.948 --> 57:31.991
Yeah, Rey's here.
She's gonna get the dagger.

57:39.332 --> 57:40.375
Whose ship is this?

57:40.542 --> 57:42.168
The ship's this way.
Follow me.

57:42.961 --> 57:43.962
<i>Over here!</i>

57:45.505 --> 57:46.505
Wrong way!

57:47.382 --> 57:49.133
There's not really a right way,
is there?

57:51.344 --> 57:52.345
<i>I found them.</i>

57:53.805 --> 57:54.889
<i>Blast them!</i>

57:59.269 --> 58:00.269
<i>Over here!</i>

58:00.270 --> 58:01.271
<i>There they are. Get them!</i>

58:17.370 --> 58:18.663
- We close?
- Straight ahead.

58:18.830 --> 58:19.831
<i>Blast them!</i>

58:22.500 --> 58:23.501
<i>Halt!</i>

58:26.754 --> 58:27.797
Poe!

58:31.259 --> 58:32.260
Are you okay?

58:33.970 --> 58:34.970
Nope.

58:35.013 --> 58:36.723
<i>You there, hands up!</i>

58:36.890 --> 58:38.349
<i>Drop your weapons now!</i>

58:38.766 --> 58:39.976
<i>Put your weapons down!</i>

58:40.143 --> 58:41.519
<i>Drop them!</i>

58:41.978 --> 58:43.521
<i>Drop them now!</i>

58:45.440 --> 58:47.567
- Hey, fellas.
<i>- Shut up, scum.</i>

59:28.524 --> 59:30.109
<i>No!</i>

59:31.069 --> 59:32.070
<i>No!</i>

59:32.612 --> 59:33.612
No.

59:33.613 --> 59:34.656
<i>Rey.</i>

59:37.367 --> 59:39.035
<i>Wherever you are...</i>

59:39.202 --> 59:40.536
<i>you are hard to find.</i>

59:40.995 --> 59:42.538
You're hard to get rid of.

59:44.540 --> 59:47.585
<i>I pushed you in the desert,
because I needed to see it.</i>

59:48.711 --> 59:50.380
<i>I needed you to see it.</i>

59:51.089 --> 59:52.548
<i>Who you are.</i>

59:53.675 --> 59:55.760
<i>I know the rest of your story.</i>

59:57.887 --> 59:58.888
<i>Rey.</i>

01:00:00.723 --> 01:00:02.058
You're lying.

01:00:02.892 --> 01:00:04.352
<i>I never lied to you.</i>

01:00:05.269 --> 01:00:06.521
<i>Your parents were no one.</i>

01:00:08.189 --> 01:00:09.440
<i>They chose to be.</i>

01:00:10.650 --> 01:00:11.818
<i>To keep you safe.</i>

01:00:11.901 --> 01:00:12.819
Don't!

01:00:12.820 --> 01:00:14.488
<i>You remember more than you say.</i>

01:00:15.071 --> 01:00:16.280
<i>I've been in your head.</i>

01:00:16.364 --> 01:00:17.364
I don't want this!

01:00:17.407 --> 01:00:18.533
<i>Search your memories.</i>

01:00:18.616 --> 01:00:19.616
No!

01:00:23.621 --> 01:00:24.956
<i>Remember them.</i>

01:00:25.498 --> 01:00:26.749
<i>See them.</i>

01:00:29.627 --> 01:00:32.005
My love. Rey, be brave.

01:00:34.799 --> 01:00:36.050
You'll be safe here.

01:00:36.718 --> 01:00:38.011
I promise.

01:00:39.929 --> 01:00:41.222
Come back!

01:00:41.389 --> 01:00:42.389
No!

01:00:48.938 --> 01:00:51.065
<i>They sold you to protect you.</i>

01:00:51.149 --> 01:00:52.275
Stop talking.

01:00:52.358 --> 01:00:54.402
<i>Rey, I know what happened to them.</i>

01:01:03.327 --> 01:01:04.454
<i>Move it.</i>

01:01:06.122 --> 01:01:08.124
<i>Allegiant General,
the scavenger is not with them.</i>

01:01:08.207 --> 01:01:10.668
Take them away. Terminate them.

01:01:16.466 --> 01:01:17.759
<i>Tell me where you are.</i>

01:01:17.842 --> 01:01:20.219
<i>You don't know the whole story.</i>

01:01:24.098 --> 01:01:27.518
<i>It was Palpatine
who had your parents taken.</i>

01:01:28.770 --> 01:01:30.480
<i>He was looking for you.</i>

01:01:31.189 --> 01:01:33.691
<i>But they wouldn't say
where you were.</i>

01:01:34.650 --> 01:01:36.319
<i>So he gave the order.</i>

01:01:40.907 --> 01:01:42.492
She isn't on Jakku.
She's gone.

01:01:43.576 --> 01:01:44.576
No!

01:01:45.870 --> 01:01:46.871
No!

01:01:56.839 --> 01:01:58.132
<i>So that's where you are.</i>

01:02:03.846 --> 01:02:06.265
<i>You know why the Emperor's always
wanted you dead.</i>

01:02:06.432 --> 01:02:07.432
No.

01:02:08.059 --> 01:02:09.352
<i>I'll come tell you.</i>

01:02:15.942 --> 01:02:18.444
<i>She was in my quarters.
Lock down the ship.</i>

01:02:22.448 --> 01:02:23.574
Actually...

01:02:25.034 --> 01:02:26.661
I'd like to do this myself.

01:02:31.165 --> 01:02:32.708
What were you gonna tell Rey before?

01:02:33.751 --> 01:02:34.794
You still on that?

01:02:35.711 --> 01:02:37.046
I'm sorry, is this a bad time?

01:02:37.213 --> 01:02:38.965
Yeah. Sort of is a bad time, Poe.

01:02:39.132 --> 01:02:41.252
Well, 'cause later doesn't really
look like an option.

01:02:41.300 --> 01:02:42.260
If you're gonna
let something off your chest,

01:02:42.261 --> 01:02:43.761
maybe now's not the worst time to...

01:02:47.890 --> 01:02:49.016
I'm the spy.

01:02:49.433 --> 01:02:50.893
- What?
- You?

01:02:51.060 --> 01:02:52.353
We don't have much time.

01:02:52.520 --> 01:02:53.604
I knew it.

01:02:53.771 --> 01:02:54.771
No, you did not.

01:02:54.897 --> 01:02:56.274
<i>What's your operating number?</i>

01:02:57.900 --> 01:02:59.110
<i>That's not even a language.</i>

01:03:03.114 --> 01:03:05.616
Oh, dear! My first laser battle.

01:03:05.783 --> 01:03:07.785
- Where are the others?
- They haven't come back.

01:03:14.250 --> 01:03:15.376
Find them.

01:03:15.543 --> 01:03:16.794
- Go.
- Yes.

01:03:21.090 --> 01:03:22.466
Friends ahead.

01:03:23.217 --> 01:03:24.343
Yes, there they are!

01:03:24.510 --> 01:03:25.510
BB-8, come on!

01:03:25.511 --> 01:03:27.322
I'll shut down the impeders.
You've got seconds.

01:03:27.346 --> 01:03:28.848
There she is.

01:03:28.973 --> 01:03:30.266
She's a survivor.

01:03:30.850 --> 01:03:32.059
Wait. Wait.

01:03:32.226 --> 01:03:34.020
- Blast me in the arm. Quick.
- What?

01:03:34.187 --> 01:03:35.188
Or they'll know.

01:03:37.356 --> 01:03:38.356
No!

01:03:39.859 --> 01:03:40.902
Why are you helping us?

01:03:41.986 --> 01:03:43.863
I don't care if you win.

01:03:44.405 --> 01:03:46.824
I need Kylo Ren to lose.

01:04:12.350 --> 01:04:14.602
Why did the Emperor come for me?

01:04:15.228 --> 01:04:17.647
Why did he want to kill a child?

01:04:18.940 --> 01:04:19.941
Tell me.

01:04:20.316 --> 01:04:22.526
<i>Because he saw
what you would become.</i>

01:04:23.611 --> 01:04:25.446
<i>You don’t just have power.</i>

01:04:27.156 --> 01:04:29.116
<i>You have his power.</i>

01:04:29.283 --> 01:04:30.409
<i>You're his granddaughter.</i>

01:04:32.286 --> 01:04:35.414
<i>You are a Palpatine.</i>

01:04:43.339 --> 01:04:45.841
<i>My mother was the daughter of Vader.</i>

01:04:46.008 --> 01:04:48.010
<i>Your father was the son of the Emperor.</i>

01:04:49.220 --> 01:04:53.474
<i>What Palpatine doesn't know is
we're a dyad in the Force, Rey.</i>

01:04:53.641 --> 01:04:55.768
<i>Two that are one.</i>

01:05:03.276 --> 01:05:08.030
<i>We'll kill him together
and take the throne.</i>

01:05:16.831 --> 01:05:18.916
You know what you need to do.

01:05:19.917 --> 01:05:21.335
You know.

01:05:30.303 --> 01:05:31.721
I do.

01:05:39.228 --> 01:05:40.228
Hold her steady.

01:05:45.151 --> 01:05:46.152
Finn, move fast!

01:05:47.611 --> 01:05:48.738
Rey!

01:05:49.196 --> 01:05:50.489
Come on!

01:05:55.202 --> 01:05:56.329
Come on! I got you!

01:06:04.754 --> 01:06:08.007
It was a coordinated incursion,
Allegiant General.

01:06:08.174 --> 01:06:11.093
They overpowered the guards and
forced me to take them to their ship.

01:06:11.719 --> 01:06:13.220
I see.

01:06:13.763 --> 01:06:15.139
Get me the Supreme Leader.

01:06:15.306 --> 01:06:16.306
Yes, sir.

01:06:20.478 --> 01:06:22.438
Tell him we found our spy.

01:06:25.524 --> 01:06:27.127
I don't know
why they're not following us,

01:06:27.151 --> 01:06:28.235
but I don't trust it.

01:06:29.195 --> 01:06:31.113
Landing gear's busted? How busted?

01:06:33.074 --> 01:06:35.743
All that matters is the wayfinder.
Finding Exegol.

01:06:35.826 --> 01:06:37.411
That's what we're doing.

01:06:42.124 --> 01:06:44.043
He killed my mother.

01:06:45.544 --> 01:06:47.338
And my father.

01:06:49.632 --> 01:06:51.509
I'm going to find Palpatine...

01:06:52.968 --> 01:06:54.345
and destroy him.

01:06:56.138 --> 01:06:57.139
Rey...

01:06:57.807 --> 01:06:59.225
that doesn't sound like you.

01:07:01.644 --> 01:07:03.270
Rey, I know you...

01:07:03.437 --> 01:07:05.189
People keep telling me they know me.

01:07:06.941 --> 01:07:08.526
I'm afraid no one does.

01:07:14.073 --> 01:07:17.243
<i>The Jedi apprentice still lives.</i>

01:07:18.536 --> 01:07:22.123
<i>Perhaps you have betrayed me.</i>

01:07:22.540 --> 01:07:26.585
<i>Do not make me
turn my fleet against you.</i>

01:07:26.752 --> 01:07:30.005
<i>I know where she's going.
She'll never be a Jedi.</i>

01:07:30.172 --> 01:07:31.674
<i>Make sure of it.</i>

01:07:31.841 --> 01:07:33.008
<i>Kill her.</i>

01:08:15.426 --> 01:08:16.886
What is that?

01:08:17.052 --> 01:08:18.262
It's the Death Star.

01:08:18.429 --> 01:08:21.098
A bad place from an old war.

01:08:21.932 --> 01:08:24.268
It's gonna take us years
to find what we're looking for.

01:08:24.435 --> 01:08:25.853
Oh, dear.

01:08:26.562 --> 01:08:28.481
"Only this blade tells."

01:09:02.848 --> 01:09:04.433
The wayfinder's there.

01:09:05.267 --> 01:09:06.310
Heads up.

01:09:13.984 --> 01:09:14.984
Rough landing.

01:09:15.069 --> 01:09:17.404
- I've seen worse.
- I've seen better.

01:09:19.532 --> 01:09:20.783
Are you Resistance?

01:09:20.950 --> 01:09:22.034
That depends.

01:09:22.201 --> 01:09:25.037
We picked up a transmission
from someone named Babu Frik.

01:09:25.204 --> 01:09:28.082
Babu Frik?
He's one of my oldest friends.

01:09:28.707 --> 01:09:30.042
He said you'd come.

01:09:30.209 --> 01:09:31.961
He said you were the last hope.

01:09:33.921 --> 01:09:35.339
We have to get to that wreck.

01:09:35.506 --> 01:09:37.106
There is something inside there we need.

01:09:37.258 --> 01:09:38.759
I can take you there by water.

01:09:38.926 --> 01:09:40.553
- Have you seen the water?
- Not now.

01:09:40.719 --> 01:09:41.804
Too dangerous.

01:09:42.429 --> 01:09:43.669
We can go first light tomorrow.

01:09:43.764 --> 01:09:45.975
We can't wait that long.
We don't have the time.

01:09:46.934 --> 01:09:48.143
Or the choice.

01:09:48.894 --> 01:09:50.104
Let's get that ship fixed.

01:09:50.646 --> 01:09:51.772
Do you have any spare parts?

01:09:51.939 --> 01:09:52.940
Some.

01:09:53.107 --> 01:09:54.567
- I'm Jannah.
- I'm Poe.

01:10:04.577 --> 01:10:05.578
Hello.

01:10:07.371 --> 01:10:09.623
No, thank you. No, thank you.

01:10:10.541 --> 01:10:12.293
What a dreadful situation.

01:10:12.459 --> 01:10:14.336
Is every day like this for you people?

01:10:14.795 --> 01:10:15.796
Madness.

01:10:15.963 --> 01:10:17.965
Did we ever find his volume control?

01:10:19.008 --> 01:10:20.676
It's an O-6, but should work.

01:10:21.135 --> 01:10:22.303
Thank you.

01:10:24.763 --> 01:10:26.223
This is a First Order part.

01:10:26.390 --> 01:10:28.309
There's an old cruiser
on the west ridge.

01:10:28.392 --> 01:10:29.392
Stripped for parts.

01:10:30.561 --> 01:10:31.979
The one we were assigned to.

01:10:32.396 --> 01:10:33.897
The one we escaped in.

01:10:34.523 --> 01:10:37.693
Okay, wait.
You were First Order?

01:10:37.860 --> 01:10:38.902
Not by choice.

01:10:41.739 --> 01:10:44.325
We were conscripted as kids.
All of us.

01:10:45.409 --> 01:10:48.078
I was TZ-1719. Stormtrooper.

01:10:48.245 --> 01:10:49.496
FN-2187.

01:10:50.581 --> 01:10:51.582
You?

01:10:51.749 --> 01:10:52.958
I never knew there were more.

01:10:53.125 --> 01:10:56.086
Deserters?
All of us here were stormtroopers.

01:10:56.587 --> 01:10:59.214
We mutinied
at the battle of Ansett Island.

01:10:59.381 --> 01:11:02.593
They told us to fire on civilians.
We wouldn't do it.

01:11:02.760 --> 01:11:04.470
We laid our weapons down.

01:11:04.637 --> 01:11:06.430
- All of you?
- The whole company.

01:11:08.098 --> 01:11:09.975
I don't even know how it happened.

01:11:11.352 --> 01:11:13.771
It wasn't a decision, really,
it was like...

01:11:13.937 --> 01:11:14.980
An instinct.

01:11:16.065 --> 01:11:17.149
Feeling.

01:11:17.941 --> 01:11:19.151
A feeling.

01:11:20.361 --> 01:11:21.612
The Force.

01:11:22.404 --> 01:11:23.947
The Force brought me here.

01:11:25.282 --> 01:11:27.868
It brought me to Rey.
And Poe.

01:11:29.078 --> 01:11:31.205
You say that like you're sure it's real.

01:11:32.164 --> 01:11:33.374
It's real.

01:11:34.083 --> 01:11:35.584
I wasn't sure then...

01:11:37.711 --> 01:11:39.046
but I am now.

01:11:40.547 --> 01:11:41.548
What is it, buddy?

01:11:44.051 --> 01:11:45.594
What do you mean you haven't seen her?

01:12:00.984 --> 01:12:02.361
She took the skimmer?

01:12:37.563 --> 01:12:38.803
What the hell was she thinking?

01:12:38.856 --> 01:12:40.733
Poe, we gotta go after her.

01:12:40.899 --> 01:12:42.627
We'll get the <i>Falcon</i> fixed,
and get out there as fast as we can.

01:12:42.651 --> 01:12:43.902
No, we're gonna lose her.

01:12:44.069 --> 01:12:45.904
Look, she left us!
What do you wanna do? Swim?

01:12:46.071 --> 01:12:48.271
She's not herself.
You have no idea what she's fighting.

01:12:48.699 --> 01:12:49.699
And you do?

01:12:51.910 --> 01:12:53.287
Yeah, I do.

01:12:54.037 --> 01:12:55.080
And so does Leia.

01:12:56.248 --> 01:12:57.708
Well, I'm not Leia.

01:12:58.292 --> 01:12:59.668
That's for damn sure.

01:13:23.484 --> 01:13:24.484
Finn.

01:13:25.402 --> 01:13:26.653
There's another skimmer.

01:16:16.823 --> 01:16:19.117
Don't be afraid of who you are.

01:16:53.235 --> 01:16:54.945
Look at yourself.

01:16:56.571 --> 01:16:58.633
You wanted to prove to my mother
that you were a Jedi...

01:16:58.657 --> 01:17:00.242
but you've proven something else.

01:17:03.829 --> 01:17:05.664
You can't go back to her now.

01:17:07.791 --> 01:17:08.959
Like I can't.

01:17:11.378 --> 01:17:12.378
Give it to me.

01:17:16.133 --> 01:17:18.844
The dark side is in our nature.

01:17:22.097 --> 01:17:23.306
Surrender to it.

01:17:24.266 --> 01:17:25.350
Give it...

01:17:25.976 --> 01:17:26.977
to me.

01:17:33.608 --> 01:17:36.987
The only way you're getting to Exegol
is with me.

01:17:38.697 --> 01:17:39.697
No!

01:18:13.065 --> 01:18:15.984
Leia knows what must be done, Artoo.

01:18:16.943 --> 01:18:19.071
To reach her son now...

01:18:19.237 --> 01:18:22.616
will take all the strength
she has left.

01:18:42.928 --> 01:18:44.179
Rey!

01:18:46.389 --> 01:18:47.808
Rey!

01:18:49.392 --> 01:18:50.644
No!

01:19:24.469 --> 01:19:25.887
No, we can't follow them!

01:19:26.054 --> 01:19:27.889
- I can't leave her!
- We can't!

01:19:28.723 --> 01:19:30.058
Rey!

01:21:08.114 --> 01:21:09.866
Ben.

01:21:40.146 --> 01:21:41.147
Leia.

01:22:59.434 --> 01:23:01.644
I did want to take your hand.

01:23:03.229 --> 01:23:04.731
Ben's hand.

01:23:46.856 --> 01:23:50.068
Goodbye, dear princess.

01:24:01.871 --> 01:24:03.790
Poe, something's happened.

01:24:03.957 --> 01:24:05.500
- Finn.
- This can't wait.

01:24:05.625 --> 01:24:07.335
We've gotta see the General.

01:24:09.295 --> 01:24:10.296
She's gone.

01:24:16.428 --> 01:24:17.720
Chewie...

01:24:43.288 --> 01:24:44.581
Hey, kid.

01:25:05.685 --> 01:25:06.936
I miss you, son.

01:25:10.106 --> 01:25:11.399
Your son is dead.

01:25:12.650 --> 01:25:13.735
No.

01:25:18.698 --> 01:25:20.950
Kylo Ren is dead.

01:25:23.244 --> 01:25:24.829
My son is alive.

01:25:29.751 --> 01:25:31.836
You're just a memory.

01:25:33.421 --> 01:25:35.089
Your memory.

01:25:39.302 --> 01:25:40.720
Come home.

01:25:41.971 --> 01:25:43.389
It's too late.

01:25:46.434 --> 01:25:47.727
She's gone.

01:25:49.896 --> 01:25:51.439
Your mother's gone.

01:25:52.857 --> 01:25:55.401
But what she stood for,
what she fought for...

01:25:56.986 --> 01:25:58.363
that's not gone.

01:26:05.036 --> 01:26:06.120
Ben.

01:26:06.996 --> 01:26:08.081
I know what I have to do...

01:26:08.164 --> 01:26:10.375
but I don't know if I have
the strength to do it.

01:26:20.802 --> 01:26:22.470
You do.

01:26:33.648 --> 01:26:34.857
Dad...

01:26:40.446 --> 01:26:42.073
I know.

01:27:03.011 --> 01:27:06.764
<i>The Princess of Alderaan
has disrupted my plan...</i>

01:27:07.348 --> 01:27:10.977
<i>but her foolish act will be in vain.</i>

01:27:11.603 --> 01:27:15.356
<i>Come to me on Exegol, General Pryde.</i>

01:27:17.859 --> 01:27:21.696
As I served you in the old wars,
I serve you now.

01:27:22.155 --> 01:27:26.117
<i>Send a ship to a world they know.</i>

01:27:26.451 --> 01:27:28.620
<i>Let it burn.</i>

01:27:28.911 --> 01:27:31.497
<i>The Final Order begins.</i>

01:27:31.664 --> 01:27:35.752
<i>She will come,
her friends will follow.</i>

01:27:36.210 --> 01:27:37.503
Yes, my lord.

01:27:47.930 --> 01:27:50.725
Levels holding steady at 85%.

01:27:52.018 --> 01:27:53.061
Captain.

01:27:54.312 --> 01:27:56.439
- Kijimi is in range.
- Fire.

01:28:15.875 --> 01:28:18.461
<i>Kijimi? How?</i>

01:28:19.379 --> 01:28:21.255
A blast from a Star Destroyer.

01:28:22.632 --> 01:28:24.425
A ship from the new Sith fleet.

01:28:24.592 --> 01:28:26.010
Out of the Unknowns.

01:28:26.302 --> 01:28:28.554
The Emperor sent a ship from Exegol.

01:28:28.721 --> 01:28:30.348
Does that mean
every ship in the fleet...

01:28:30.431 --> 01:28:32.767
Has planet-killing weapons.
Of course they do.

01:28:33.559 --> 01:28:34.560
All of them.

01:28:35.228 --> 01:28:36.813
This is how he finishes it.

01:28:36.979 --> 01:28:37.980
Listen.

01:28:38.523 --> 01:28:40.316
It's on every frequency.

01:28:42.026 --> 01:28:43.695
"The Resistance is dead.

01:28:44.320 --> 01:28:46.114
"The Sith flame will burn.

01:28:47.156 --> 01:28:49.575
"All worlds, surrender or die.

01:28:50.368 --> 01:28:52.370
"The Final Order begins."

01:28:53.246 --> 01:28:54.706
Leia made you acting general.

01:28:56.124 --> 01:28:57.542
What now?

01:29:06.217 --> 01:29:08.219
I gotta tell you,
I don't really know...

01:29:09.303 --> 01:29:10.722
how to do this.

01:29:12.306 --> 01:29:13.891
What you did...

01:29:15.852 --> 01:29:17.353
I'm not ready.

01:29:18.896 --> 01:29:20.273
Neither were we.

01:29:23.818 --> 01:29:25.820
Luke, Han, Leia, me...

01:29:26.738 --> 01:29:27.905
Who's ever ready?

01:29:28.614 --> 01:29:29.741
How'd you do it?

01:29:31.617 --> 01:29:34.662
Defeat an empire with almost nothing.

01:29:34.996 --> 01:29:36.456
We had each other.

01:29:37.707 --> 01:29:39.333
That's how we won.

01:29:42.920 --> 01:29:44.672
Hey, don't touch that.
That's my friend's.

01:29:44.756 --> 01:29:46.674
Sorry. She is gone?

01:29:47.633 --> 01:29:48.760
Yeah, she's gone.

01:29:48.926 --> 01:29:50.011
I don't know where.

01:29:51.095 --> 01:29:52.096
I miss her.

01:29:52.555 --> 01:29:53.639
I miss her, too.

01:29:56.642 --> 01:29:58.186
So, what's your name?

01:29:58.352 --> 01:30:00.914
- I gotta talk to you about something.
- I gotta talk to you about something.

01:30:00.938 --> 01:30:02.273
I can't do this alone.

01:30:02.440 --> 01:30:03.691
I need you in command with me.

01:30:03.858 --> 01:30:05.943
This droid has...
Thank you. I appreciate that.

01:30:06.110 --> 01:30:07.236
- General.
- General.

01:30:07.403 --> 01:30:09.447
This droid has a ton of information
about Exegol.

01:30:09.530 --> 01:30:10.930
- Wait, what? Cone-face?
- I am D-O.

01:30:10.990 --> 01:30:12.158
Sorry, D-O.

01:30:12.325 --> 01:30:14.619
He was going to Exegol
with Ochi of Bestoon.

01:30:14.911 --> 01:30:16.204
Why was Ochi going there?

01:30:16.287 --> 01:30:19.832
To bring the little girl he was supposed
to take from Jakku to the Emperor.

01:30:19.999 --> 01:30:22.001
He wanted her alive.

01:31:12.176 --> 01:31:15.596
A Jedi's weapon deserves more respect.

01:31:17.807 --> 01:31:19.517
Master Skywalker.

01:31:20.101 --> 01:31:22.687
What are you doing?

01:31:23.104 --> 01:31:25.273
I saw myself on the dark throne.

01:31:25.773 --> 01:31:27.358
I won't let it happen.

01:31:27.525 --> 01:31:29.902
I'm never leaving this place.
I'm doing what you did.

01:31:30.778 --> 01:31:32.488
I was wrong.

01:31:33.865 --> 01:31:36.158
It was fear that kept me here.

01:31:37.785 --> 01:31:39.412
What are you most afraid of?

01:31:44.041 --> 01:31:45.042
Myself.

01:31:48.212 --> 01:31:49.964
Because you're a Palpatine.

01:31:52.383 --> 01:31:54.093
Leia knew it, too.

01:31:55.261 --> 01:31:56.596
She didn't tell me.

01:32:04.061 --> 01:32:05.605
She still trained me.

01:32:06.647 --> 01:32:09.025
Because she saw your spirit.

01:32:09.483 --> 01:32:11.027
Your heart.

01:32:13.905 --> 01:32:14.947
Rey.

01:32:16.365 --> 01:32:18.576
Some things are stronger than blood.

01:32:19.702 --> 01:32:22.747
Confronting fear
is the destiny of a Jedi.

01:32:23.247 --> 01:32:24.749
Your destiny.

01:32:25.124 --> 01:32:26.834
If you don't face Palpatine...

01:32:27.293 --> 01:32:29.337
it will mean the end of the Jedi.

01:32:30.880 --> 01:32:32.673
And the war will be lost.

01:32:36.510 --> 01:32:39.221
There's something
my sister would want you to have.

01:32:54.779 --> 01:32:56.280
Leia's saber.

01:32:58.407 --> 01:33:00.451
It was the last night of her training.

01:33:18.052 --> 01:33:21.263
<i>Leia told me that she had sensed
the death of her son</i>

01:33:21.347 --> 01:33:23.349
<i>at the end of her Jedi path.</i>

01:33:24.809 --> 01:33:27.895
<i>She surrendered her saber to me
and said that one day...</i>

01:33:28.562 --> 01:33:30.606
it would be picked up again...

01:33:30.773 --> 01:33:33.651
by someone who would finish her journey.

01:33:35.736 --> 01:33:39.073
A thousand generations live in you now.

01:33:40.157 --> 01:33:42.201
But this is your fight.

01:33:43.285 --> 01:33:45.913
You'll take both sabers to Exegol.

01:33:48.290 --> 01:33:49.625
I can't get there.

01:33:49.792 --> 01:33:52.545
I don't have the wayfinder.
I destroyed Ren's ship.

01:33:52.712 --> 01:33:55.131
You have everything you need.

01:34:05.307 --> 01:34:06.851
Two were made.

01:35:04.033 --> 01:35:08.079
Hello. I am C-3PO,
human-cyborg relations.

01:35:08.245 --> 01:35:09.663
And you are?

01:35:10.456 --> 01:35:11.457
What?

01:35:13.125 --> 01:35:16.712
Well, I am quite certain
I would remember if I had a best friend.

01:35:18.339 --> 01:35:21.425
You want to put what in my head?
Under no circumstances...

01:35:24.845 --> 01:35:26.889
Memory restoration complete.

01:35:27.848 --> 01:35:29.183
Artoo, have you heard?

01:35:29.350 --> 01:35:32.103
I am going with Mistress Rey
on her very first mission.

01:35:33.562 --> 01:35:34.897
I already have?

01:35:36.148 --> 01:35:38.150
Picking up a signal?
From whom?

01:35:44.240 --> 01:35:46.617
All the information you need
for an airstrike on Exegol.

01:35:46.700 --> 01:35:47.886
Yeah, except how to get there.

01:35:47.910 --> 01:35:50.097
- Are you seeing these atmo readings?
- It's a mess out there.

01:35:50.121 --> 01:35:51.163
Magnetic crossfields.

01:35:51.330 --> 01:35:52.915
Gravity wells, solar winds.

01:35:52.998 --> 01:35:54.267
How does a fleet
even take off from there?

01:35:54.291 --> 01:35:55.291
Terribly sorry.

01:35:55.292 --> 01:35:56.710
I'm afraid Artoo's memory bank

01:35:56.794 --> 01:35:58.879
must be crossed
with his logic receptors.

01:35:59.547 --> 01:36:03.676
He says he is receiving a transmission
from Master Luke.

01:36:04.552 --> 01:36:06.053
That's an old craft ID.

01:36:07.138 --> 01:36:08.931
That's Luke Skywalker's X-wing.

01:36:09.098 --> 01:36:12.935
It's transmitting course marker signals
on its way to the Unknown Regions.

01:36:13.102 --> 01:36:14.228
It's Rey.

01:36:18.941 --> 01:36:20.442
<i>She's going to Exegol.</i>

01:36:25.239 --> 01:36:26.615
She's showing us.

01:36:26.782 --> 01:36:28.367
She's showing us how to get there.

01:36:30.411 --> 01:36:31.954
Then we go together.

01:36:38.002 --> 01:36:39.628
Come on, buddy, we need you.

01:36:40.838 --> 01:36:44.341
As long as those Star Destroyers
are on Exegol we can hit them.

01:36:44.508 --> 01:36:45.593
Hit them how?

01:36:45.759 --> 01:36:48.304
They can't activate their shields
until they leave atmosphere.

01:36:48.470 --> 01:36:51.682
Which isn't easy on Exegol.
Ships that size need help taking off.

01:36:51.849 --> 01:36:53.475
Nav can't tell which way's up out there.

01:36:53.642 --> 01:36:54.894
So, how do the ships take off?

01:36:55.060 --> 01:36:58.314
They use a signal
from a navigation tower, like this one.

01:36:59.190 --> 01:37:00.357
Except they won't.

01:37:00.441 --> 01:37:02.881
Air team's gonna find the tower,
ground team's gonna blast it.

01:37:03.027 --> 01:37:04.987
- Ground team?
- I have an idea for that.

01:37:05.154 --> 01:37:07.048
Once the tower's down,
the fleet will be stuck in atmo...

01:37:07.072 --> 01:37:09.783
for just minutes, with no shields,
and no way out.

01:37:09.950 --> 01:37:12.620
We think hitting the cannons
might ignite the main reactors.

01:37:13.245 --> 01:37:14.705
That's our chance.

01:37:14.872 --> 01:37:17.499
We need to pull some Holdo maneuvers.
Do some real damage.

01:37:17.666 --> 01:37:19.251
Come on. That move is one in a million.

01:37:19.418 --> 01:37:22.189
Fighters and freighters can take out
their cannons if there are enough of us.

01:37:22.213 --> 01:37:23.797
There aren't enough of us!

01:37:23.964 --> 01:37:26.133
He's right.
We'd be no more than bugs to them.

01:37:26.217 --> 01:37:27.760
That's where Lando and Chewie come in.

01:37:28.302 --> 01:37:30.512
They'll take the <i>Falcon</i>
to the Core Systems.

01:37:30.679 --> 01:37:32.848
Send out a call for help
for anybody listening.

01:37:33.015 --> 01:37:34.266
We've got friends out there.

01:37:34.433 --> 01:37:35.993
They'll come if they know there's hope.

01:37:37.519 --> 01:37:38.646
They will.

01:37:39.730 --> 01:37:42.399
First Order wins by making us think
we're alone.

01:37:43.192 --> 01:37:44.443
We're not alone.

01:37:45.152 --> 01:37:47.613
Good people will fight if we lead them.

01:37:50.741 --> 01:37:52.576
<i>Leia never gave up.</i>

01:37:53.285 --> 01:37:54.870
<i>And neither will we.</i>

01:37:55.913 --> 01:37:57.915
<i>We're gonna show them
we're not afraid.</i>

01:38:02.586 --> 01:38:04.755
<i>What our mothers and fathers
fought for...</i>

01:38:05.172 --> 01:38:06.966
<i>we will not let die.</i>

01:38:09.551 --> 01:38:10.719
<i>Not today.</i>

01:38:12.179 --> 01:38:14.723
<i>Today, we make our last stand.</i>

01:38:15.474 --> 01:38:17.017
<i>For the galaxy.</i>

01:38:19.061 --> 01:38:20.271
<i>For Leia.</i>

01:38:23.148 --> 01:38:24.733
For everyone we've lost.

01:38:26.026 --> 01:38:27.736
They've taken enough of us.

01:38:28.654 --> 01:38:30.739
Now we take the war to them.

01:38:57.516 --> 01:38:59.018
<i>She's on approach.</i>

01:38:59.184 --> 01:39:01.645
<i>All ships rise to deployment altitude.</i>

01:39:41.894 --> 01:39:43.187
I know it's a rough ride...

01:39:43.645 --> 01:39:45.064
but stay locked on Rey's course.

01:39:51.945 --> 01:39:53.489
<i>Clear run frequency.</i>

01:39:53.655 --> 01:39:55.574
<i>Captain, we have
Resistance craft incoming.</i>

01:39:55.991 --> 01:39:56.992
Allegiant General...

01:39:57.159 --> 01:39:58.410
<i>Use ion cannons!</i>

01:40:03.916 --> 01:40:05.167
Look at that fleet.

01:40:08.629 --> 01:40:09.629
Damn it!

01:40:11.382 --> 01:40:12.549
Welcome to Exegol.

01:40:16.178 --> 01:40:17.429
Watch your starboard, Wexley!

01:40:19.431 --> 01:40:20.682
Get to their altitude.

01:40:20.849 --> 01:40:22.769
They can't fire on us
without hitting each other.

01:40:23.811 --> 01:40:24.937
Don't give up.

01:40:25.354 --> 01:40:26.772
Help is coming.

01:40:28.148 --> 01:40:29.233
There it is.

01:40:29.400 --> 01:40:30.984
Poe, I see it.

01:40:31.151 --> 01:40:32.391
I've got a visual on the tower.

01:41:21.368 --> 01:41:22.326
Incoming TIEs!

01:41:22.327 --> 01:41:23.327
I see 'em!

01:41:23.328 --> 01:41:24.328
I got you, Finn.

01:41:28.709 --> 01:41:30.469
- You ready back there?
- Never been readier.

01:41:33.130 --> 01:41:34.798
They're targeting
the navigation tower...

01:41:34.965 --> 01:41:36.091
so the fleet can't deploy.

01:41:36.258 --> 01:41:37.402
Then we won't use that tower.

01:41:37.426 --> 01:41:40.637
Switch over the source
of navigation signal to this ship.

01:41:40.804 --> 01:41:42.473
We'll guide the fleet out ourselves.

01:41:48.604 --> 01:41:50.606
The navigation tower
has been deactivated.

01:41:50.981 --> 01:41:52.733
- What?
- Those ships need that signal.

01:41:52.900 --> 01:41:54.335
It's gotta be coming from somewhere.

01:41:54.359 --> 01:41:56.028
<i>They figured out what we're doing.</i>

01:41:56.195 --> 01:41:58.071
<i>Call off the ground invasion.</i>

01:41:58.238 --> 01:41:59.238
Wait.

01:42:00.532 --> 01:42:02.618
The nav signal's coming
from that command ship.

01:42:02.701 --> 01:42:04.328
That's our drop zone.

01:42:04.495 --> 01:42:05.662
How do you know?

01:42:06.663 --> 01:42:07.663
A feeling.

01:42:07.748 --> 01:42:10.542
You wanna launch a ground invasion
on a Star Destroyer?

01:42:10.709 --> 01:42:13.521
I don't want to, but we can't take out
that ship's nav system from the air.

01:42:13.545 --> 01:42:14.546
Give us cover.

01:42:14.713 --> 01:42:16.316
We gotta keep that fleet there
till help arrives.

01:42:16.340 --> 01:42:17.591
- We hope.
- We hope.

01:42:18.926 --> 01:42:20.177
You heard the General.

01:42:20.344 --> 01:42:22.846
All Wings, cover that lander.

01:42:27.684 --> 01:42:29.728
They've landed a troop carrier.

01:42:29.895 --> 01:42:31.605
- Jam the speeders.
- I can't, sir.

01:42:31.772 --> 01:42:32.772
Why not?

01:42:33.732 --> 01:42:34.942
They're not using speeders.

01:42:40.906 --> 01:42:42.157
Not bad for one lesson.

01:42:43.200 --> 01:42:44.701
You had a good teacher!

01:42:52.251 --> 01:42:53.252
Keep going!

01:42:58.924 --> 01:43:00.384
You're doing great, buddy!

01:43:00.551 --> 01:43:02.052
The tower's up ahead.

01:44:06.783 --> 01:44:09.620
Long have I waited.

01:44:19.713 --> 01:44:23.634
For my grandchild to come home.

01:44:25.969 --> 01:44:28.680
I never wanted you dead.

01:44:28.764 --> 01:44:30.974
I wanted you here...

01:44:31.516 --> 01:44:33.685
Empress Palpatine.

01:44:36.229 --> 01:44:38.106
You will take the throne.

01:44:40.817 --> 01:44:44.529
It is your birthright to rule here.

01:44:45.447 --> 01:44:49.076
It is in your blood.
Our blood.

01:44:50.952 --> 01:44:52.871
I haven't come to lead the Sith...

01:44:53.830 --> 01:44:55.374
I have come to end them.

01:44:55.540 --> 01:44:57.250
As a Jedi?

01:44:57.626 --> 01:44:59.961
- Yes.
- No.

01:45:00.170 --> 01:45:03.507
Your hatred, your anger.

01:45:04.257 --> 01:45:06.593
You want to kill me.

01:45:07.969 --> 01:45:09.971
That is what I want.

01:45:11.473 --> 01:45:13.016
Kill me...

01:45:13.183 --> 01:45:16.353
and my spirit will pass into you.

01:45:16.770 --> 01:45:20.023
As all the Sith live in me...

01:45:20.565 --> 01:45:22.984
you will be Empress...

01:45:23.527 --> 01:45:25.570
we will be one.

01:45:33.286 --> 01:45:35.288
Those thrusters are hot.
How are we doing?

01:45:35.372 --> 01:45:37.666
We're gonna blow our way in,
and take out that nav tower.

01:45:37.833 --> 01:45:39.113
All the hatches are blast-proof!

01:45:39.251 --> 01:45:40.627
All right, BB-8, you're up!

01:45:40.794 --> 01:45:42.087
I'll cover you.

01:46:10.073 --> 01:46:11.658
This should do it.

01:46:23.837 --> 01:46:25.005
There it goes.

01:46:26.590 --> 01:46:27.966
Nice one, Finn.

01:46:28.133 --> 01:46:30.051
Nav signal's down, but not for long.

01:46:30.135 --> 01:46:31.428
We're offline, sir.

01:46:32.637 --> 01:46:34.014
Reset the navigation signal!

01:46:34.097 --> 01:46:35.140
Minutes away, sir.

01:46:36.975 --> 01:46:39.186
- Finn, let's go!
- No, no, wait, listen.

01:46:39.352 --> 01:46:41.456
The crown cannons have stopped.
They're resetting their systems.

01:46:41.480 --> 01:46:44.107
- So?
- I gotta go do something.

01:46:44.900 --> 01:46:46.359
I'm staying with you.

01:46:48.612 --> 01:46:50.030
Still no <i>Falcon</i> or backup.

01:46:51.656 --> 01:46:54.826
I don't know, Artoo.
Maybe nobody else is coming.

01:46:54.910 --> 01:46:55.911
What do we do, General?

01:46:57.162 --> 01:46:58.747
We gotta hit them ourselves.

01:46:58.955 --> 01:47:00.099
What can we do against these things?

01:47:00.123 --> 01:47:01.792
<i>Just stay alive!</i>

01:47:04.085 --> 01:47:06.296
The time has come!

01:47:16.223 --> 01:47:19.684
With your hatred,
you will take my life.

01:47:19.893 --> 01:47:21.770
And you will ascend.

01:47:23.396 --> 01:47:26.650
All you want is for me to hate,
but I won't.

01:47:27.484 --> 01:47:28.819
Not even you.

01:47:29.945 --> 01:47:33.073
Weak.
Like your parents.

01:47:34.407 --> 01:47:36.076
My parents were strong.

01:47:37.077 --> 01:47:38.995
They saved me from you.

01:47:39.329 --> 01:47:43.667
Your Master, Luke Skywalker,
was saved by his father.

01:47:43.834 --> 01:47:47.295
The only family you have here...

01:47:47.838 --> 01:47:49.130
is me.

01:48:10.527 --> 01:48:12.612
They don't have long.

01:48:13.780 --> 01:48:16.533
<i>No one is coming to help them.</i>

01:48:17.450 --> 01:48:21.162
<i>And you are the one who led them here.</i>

01:48:22.581 --> 01:48:26.001
<i>Strike me down.
Take the throne.</i>

01:48:26.167 --> 01:48:28.211
<i>Reign over the new Empire...</i>

01:48:28.378 --> 01:48:31.214
<i>and the fleet will be yours.</i>

01:48:32.966 --> 01:48:36.803
<i>Only you have the power to save them.</i>

01:48:39.097 --> 01:48:43.560
<i>Refuse, and your new family...</i>

01:48:44.603 --> 01:48:46.396
dies.

01:49:04.539 --> 01:49:06.082
Good.

01:49:21.806 --> 01:49:24.517
Finn, where are you?
The lander's leaving.

01:49:25.268 --> 01:49:27.646
<i>- Finn!</i>
- Go without us.

01:49:27.812 --> 01:49:29.481
We're taking this entire ship down.

01:49:31.316 --> 01:49:32.692
What? How?

01:49:32.859 --> 01:49:34.277
<i>We're gonna hit the command deck.</i>

01:49:35.195 --> 01:49:37.906
Rose, please.
Go.

01:49:39.616 --> 01:49:40.617
- Rose!
- Rose!

01:49:41.743 --> 01:49:43.286
I'll get the trigger!

01:49:45.872 --> 01:49:48.249
The ritual begins.

01:49:49.751 --> 01:49:51.544
She will strike me down...

01:49:52.045 --> 01:49:55.298
and pledge herself as a Sith.

01:50:15.819 --> 01:50:18.113
<i>She will draw her weapon.</i>

01:50:21.032 --> 01:50:23.201
She will come to me.

01:50:36.965 --> 01:50:39.467
She will take her revenge.

01:50:45.640 --> 01:50:48.393
And with a stroke of her saber...

01:50:48.560 --> 01:50:51.312
the Sith are reborn!

01:50:52.605 --> 01:50:55.316
The Jedi are dead!

01:51:16.671 --> 01:51:17.797
Do it!

01:51:17.881 --> 01:51:20.091
Make the sacrifice!

01:52:29.702 --> 01:52:33.039
Stand together, die together.

01:52:42.757 --> 01:52:45.677
The lifeforce of your bond...

01:52:48.221 --> 01:52:51.599
a dyad in the Force.

01:52:51.766 --> 01:52:54.894
A power like life itself.

01:52:55.854 --> 01:52:59.357
Unseen for generations.

01:52:59.524 --> 01:53:01.151
And now...

01:53:01.609 --> 01:53:07.782
the power of two restores
the one, true Emperor.

01:53:29.554 --> 01:53:31.434
<i>- Snap, they're on your tail.</i>
- Yeah, I see 'em!

01:53:31.514 --> 01:53:33.516
No, no, no, Snap, Snap!

01:53:34.309 --> 01:53:35.518
No!

01:53:37.520 --> 01:53:39.647
<i>Alpha Three is down.</i>

01:53:40.064 --> 01:53:42.317
<i>They're on my tail! I can't get...</i>

01:53:42.483 --> 01:53:43.985
<i>They're everywhere!</i>

01:53:45.778 --> 01:53:47.363
<i>Delta leader's hit!</i>

01:53:48.281 --> 01:53:49.324
<i>Losing altitude!</i>

01:53:49.407 --> 01:53:50.825
<i>General, what's our next move?</i>

01:53:51.534 --> 01:53:53.369
<i>Poe, what now?</i>

01:53:53.536 --> 01:53:54.787
My friends...

01:53:57.290 --> 01:53:58.499
I'm sorry.

01:53:59.834 --> 01:54:01.336
I thought we had a shot.

01:54:03.213 --> 01:54:04.964
But there's just too many of them.

01:54:06.174 --> 01:54:07.967
<i>But there are more of us, Poe.</i>

01:54:08.718 --> 01:54:10.511
<i>There are more of us.</i>

01:54:21.564 --> 01:54:22.982
Look at this.

01:54:23.608 --> 01:54:25.151
Look at this.

01:54:34.035 --> 01:54:36.788
Lando, you did it.
You did it!

01:54:39.249 --> 01:54:43.002
Hit those underbelly cannons.
Every one we knock out is a world saved.

01:54:46.172 --> 01:54:47.382
Nice flying, Lando.

01:54:57.850 --> 01:54:59.570
We have a ship down.
We've lost a Destroyer.

01:54:59.644 --> 01:55:00.979
Systems not responding.

01:55:01.145 --> 01:55:02.289
Where did they get
all these fighter craft?

01:55:02.313 --> 01:55:03.313
They have no navy.

01:55:03.356 --> 01:55:06.401
It's not a navy, sir, it's just people.

01:55:17.412 --> 01:55:19.205
<i>So long, sky trash!</i>

01:55:19.372 --> 01:55:20.456
Who's that flyer?

01:55:20.623 --> 01:55:22.709
<i>Take a guess, spice runner.</i>

01:55:25.628 --> 01:55:27.630
Zorii! You made it!

01:55:40.393 --> 01:55:43.521
Look what you have made.

01:56:03.249 --> 01:56:05.793
As once I fell...

01:56:05.960 --> 01:56:10.089
so falls the last Skywalker.

01:56:17.472 --> 01:56:20.850
Do not fear that feeble attack...

01:56:21.017 --> 01:56:22.602
my faithful.

01:56:23.394 --> 01:56:27.106
Nothing will stop
the return of the Sith!

01:56:38.993 --> 01:56:40.787
Artoo, my systems are failing.

01:56:41.913 --> 01:56:43.122
Does anyone copy?

01:57:24.622 --> 01:57:26.207
Be with me.

01:57:31.045 --> 01:57:32.797
Be with me.

01:57:38.428 --> 01:57:40.179
Be with me.

01:57:43.766 --> 01:57:46.686
<i>These are your final steps, Rey.</i>

01:57:46.853 --> 01:57:49.480
<i>Rise and take them.</i>

01:57:49.939 --> 01:57:51.566
<i>- Rey.
- Rey.</i>

01:57:51.732 --> 01:57:52.732
<i>Rey.</i>

01:57:52.733 --> 01:57:54.902
<i>Bring back the balance, Rey,
as I did.</i>

01:57:55.069 --> 01:57:57.405
<i>In the night, find the light, Rey.</i>

01:57:57.572 --> 01:57:59.115
<i>You're not alone, Rey.</i>

01:57:59.282 --> 01:58:01.367
<i>Alone never have you been.</i>

01:58:01.534 --> 01:58:04.537
<i>Every Jedi who ever lived
lives in you.</i>

01:58:04.704 --> 01:58:06.080
<i>The Force surrounds you, Rey.</i>

01:58:06.247 --> 01:58:08.040
<i>- Let it guide you.
- As it guided us.</i>

01:58:08.207 --> 01:58:10.418
<i>Feel the Force flowing through you, Rey.</i>

01:58:10.585 --> 01:58:11.627
<i>Let it lift you.</i>

01:58:11.794 --> 01:58:13.004
<i>Rise, Rey.</i>

01:58:13.713 --> 01:58:15.256
<i>We stand behind you, Rey.</i>

01:58:15.423 --> 01:58:16.423
<i>Rey.</i>

01:58:16.424 --> 01:58:17.758
<i>Rise in the Force.</i>

01:58:18.801 --> 01:58:21.762
<i>In the heart of a Jedi
lies her strength.</i>

01:58:22.722 --> 01:58:23.722
<i>Rise.</i>

01:58:23.723 --> 01:58:24.724
<i>Rise.</i>

01:58:25.183 --> 01:58:30.271
<i>Rey, the Force will be with you, always.</i>

01:58:48.748 --> 01:58:51.918
Let your death be the final word...

01:58:52.084 --> 01:58:54.879
in the story of rebellion.

01:59:06.057 --> 01:59:07.057
I'm back on!

01:59:07.183 --> 01:59:10.102
This is our last chance.
We gotta hit those cannons now!

01:59:15.441 --> 01:59:17.443
You are nothing!

01:59:17.610 --> 01:59:21.531
A scavenger girl is no match
for the power in me.

01:59:24.909 --> 01:59:28.079
I am all the Sith!

01:59:31.374 --> 01:59:33.084
And I...

01:59:38.506 --> 01:59:40.383
I'm all the Jedi.

02:00:30.850 --> 02:00:32.393
Poe, the command ship!

02:00:33.978 --> 02:00:35.479
<i>Their fleet is stuck here!</i>

02:00:35.646 --> 02:00:36.856
They're toast!
Come on!

02:00:40.860 --> 02:00:42.278
Finn, you seeing this?

02:00:42.445 --> 02:00:43.605
Finn didn't board the lander.

02:00:44.196 --> 02:00:45.990
They're still on that command ship?

02:00:56.709 --> 02:00:59.003
I see them.
I'm going to get them.

02:00:59.754 --> 02:01:01.047
General, you won't make it.

02:01:01.213 --> 02:01:02.465
Trust me, I'm fast!

02:01:02.632 --> 02:01:04.467
<i>Not as fast as this ship.</i>

02:01:07.386 --> 02:01:08.971
Hold on, Chewie!

02:01:19.148 --> 02:01:20.733
Finn!

02:01:55.976 --> 02:01:58.104
No, Rey.

02:04:21.121 --> 02:04:22.540
Ben.

02:05:44.788 --> 02:05:46.290
<i>There, look!</i>

02:05:47.207 --> 02:05:48.584
Red Five is in the air.

02:05:48.667 --> 02:05:49.919
Rey's alive.

02:05:51.712 --> 02:05:52.838
I see her.

02:05:52.922 --> 02:05:55.382
<i>People are rising up
all over the galaxy.</i>

02:05:57.092 --> 02:05:59.136
<i>Poe. We did it.</i>

02:05:59.303 --> 02:06:00.346
We did it.

02:06:57.695 --> 02:06:58.696
Happy.

02:07:02.825 --> 02:07:03.951
Chewie!

02:07:34.732 --> 02:07:35.774
Hi!

02:07:35.941 --> 02:07:37.026
Good job!

02:07:41.905 --> 02:07:43.115
Chewie.

02:07:45.701 --> 02:07:47.578
This is for you.

02:08:06.597 --> 02:08:07.723
Did you hear that?

02:08:34.333 --> 02:08:36.043
Where are you from, General?

02:08:36.210 --> 02:08:38.003
The Gold system.

02:08:42.716 --> 02:08:44.009
Well, what about you, kid?

02:08:46.345 --> 02:08:47.596
I don't know.

02:08:49.807 --> 02:08:51.475
Well, let's find out.

02:11:31.635 --> 02:11:33.929
There's been no one for so long.

02:11:34.805 --> 02:11:36.306
Who are you?

02:11:37.933 --> 02:11:39.351
I'm Rey.

02:11:40.560 --> 02:11:41.687
Rey who?

02:12:06.503 --> 02:12:07.879
Rey Skywalker.
